    <Description>This macro is made for the Python and is designed to be used with the HOLOSIGHT and IRONSIGHT. This macro works best with FOV90 and SENSE0.7. This macro is designed to make you look like a pro player and reduces the chance of being banned and detected. This macro rapid fires the Python with little to no recoil.</Description>
